{"unit_id":"tag:08PH:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为函子（functor）。赋予 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003> 混沌（chaotic）拓扑（topology），如例 <REF_0001> 中所述。函子（functors）<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005> 和 <MATH_0006>，其中 <MATH_0007> 是只有一个对象（object）和一个态射（morphism）的范畴（category），是余连续（cocontinuous）且连续（continuous）的。设\n<MATH_0008>、\n<MATH_0009> 和\n<MATH_0010>\n为对应的拓扑斯的态射（morphisms of topoi）。设 <MATH_0011> 为环（ring）。赋予 <MATH_0012> 环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0013>，并赋予 <MATH_0014>、<MATH_0015> 常值（constant）层（sheaf）<MATH_0016>。这样，\n<MATH_0017>\n是情形 <REF_0002> 的例子。因此，引理 <REF_0003> 适用于 <MATH_0018>，所以不必区分 <MATH_0019> 在模（modules）上或阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）上的作用。特别地，注记 <REF_0004> 产生典范（canonical）映射（maps）\n<MATH_0020>，\n只要有 <MATH_0021>，位于 <MATH_0022> 中，<MATH_0023>，位于 <MATH_0024> 中，以及映射（map）<MATH_0025>。按照例 <REF_0005> 中给出的同调（homology）计算，可见这些映射（maps）来自复形（complexes）的映射（map）\n<MATH_0026>，\n由规则\n<MATH_0027>\n给出，记号的含义显见。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"chaotic","target_term":"混沌"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"sheaf of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":