{"unit_id":"tag:08Q6:statement","translation":"记号与假设如例 <REF_0001> 中所述。设 <MATH_0001> 为有界（bounded）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0002> 上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）组成。对任意对象（object）<MATH_0003>，属于 <MATH_0004>，有典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0005>，\n位于 <MATH_0006> 中。若 <MATH_0007> 为由 <MATH_0008>-模（modules）组成的复形（complex），则此映射（map）位于 <MATH_0009> 中。为证明这一点，注意计算 <MATH_0010> 时取拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）\n<MATH_0011>，\n其中 <MATH_0012> 为复形（complex），其各项投射（projectives）。然而，由于拓扑（topology）混沌（chaotic），这意味着 <MATH_0013> 为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism），因而可在 <MATH_0014>，相应地<SPACE_0001><MATH_0015> 中求逆。与典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0016> 复合，后者来自将 <MATH_0017> 作为余极限（colimit）的计算，得到所需箭头。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"bounded","target_term":"有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"projectives","target_term":"投射"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"chaotic","target_term":"混沌"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"bounded","target_term":"有界","context":"输入复形的范围"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"导出对象及投射代表"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"输入系数"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"取值的位点对象"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"到导出余极限的比较"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"赋环系数版本"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"导出范畴中的比较"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"投射分解与逐点